    "detailed_description": "<strong>NinjaFall </strong>is a<u> ninja combat game.</u> Inspired by new-classics from <i>Duck Game </i>to <i>TowerFall</i>, it's a 4-player local and online fighting game centering around creating your own Ninjutsu to use in versus matches. The core mechanics are simple and accessible, but hard to master. Select from a variety of different NinjaTools, a selection of unique levels and create dozens of different jutsu on command. NinjaFall is best played competitively with friends!<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Features NinfaFall include:<br></li><li>Arcade Mode: Climb the tower to victory.<br></li><li>8 Distinct maps.<br></li><li>Multiple game changing NinjaTools.<br></li><li>An online mode to challenge friends across the world.<br></li><li>Multiple Characters.<br></li><li>Over 25 different jutsu to create on the fly.</li></ul>",
